#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Passionlip's first SG.\n\nA mysterious ZONE possessed by women of plentiful breasts.\nFrom the perspective of men, it's filled with much romance,\nbut Lip's is not such a dream.\n\nBreast Valley is a recycle bin made using imaginary space.\nAn endless pocket that can store anything may sound nice,\nbut its true nature is a deep chasm meant for disposal.\n\nAnything stored in the Valley cannot resurface on its own.\nWithout external intervention…… a third party outside,\nexit from the Valley is impossible.\nLike someone who's plummeted to the bottom of a ravine.\n\n             ◆\n\nWhile her enormous bust is her trademark,\nat the same time, they're also her private areas.\nFor an introverted personality like Lip, this intense,\nself-asserting part of her only causes anxiety.\nNot to mention, possessing such obscene features,\nit's only natural to want to keep them hidden.\n\n\n……however. That this secret can be revealed at a glance\nno matter how this Alter Ego twists it, is a clear sign\nof being a contradictory AI.\n\nTo talk of valleys of breasts is fine, but in olden times,\nall that lay in chasms were tragic corpses for the wolves.\nLet's hold back on such pursuits of romance.\n"
msgstr ""

